 השּׁ v 2Kgs 23:11 . — See also ׳ בֵּית שׁ p. 112:b. 4. other phrase: \\ \\ a. ׳ נֶגֶד חַשּׁ , i.e. openly, publicly , 2Sam 12:12 ; Num 25:4 ( P ), so ׳ לְעֵינֵי חַשּׁ 2Sam 12:11 . \\ \\ b. figurative of living, ׳ חָזָה שׁ Ps 58:9 , ׳ רָאָה שׁ Exod 6:5 ; Exod 7:11 ; Exod 11:7 , opposed to ׳ תֶּחְשַׁךְ הַשׁ Exod 12:2 . \\ \\ c. ׳ תַּחַת הַשּׁ , i. e. on the earth, Eccl 1:3 + 28 t. Ecclesiastes (compare Greek ὐφ’ ἠλίῳ , Kue Ond. iii. 196 ; Ein1. iii. 192). 5. pinnacle , as glittering, shining , plural Isa 54:12 thy pinnacles, battlements (of Zion), so perhaps singular אֱםהִים ׳ וּמָנֵן י ׳ שׁ Ps 84:12 battlement and shield is ׳ א ׳ י ( Gr Bae Du Buhl ; most sun , and so Thes De Che SS ; Hup-Now hesitates).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8874')\">BDB8874</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8121')\">H8121</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8873')\">BDB8873</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8875')\">BDB8875</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שֶׁ֫מֶשׁ</bdbheb><sub>133</sub> <b>noun feminine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Judg 19:14\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(7,19,14)\">Judg 19:14</ref></sup> <b>and masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Gen 19:23\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,23)\">Gen 19:23</ref></sup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Albr.')\">Albr<sup>ZAW xv (1895), 324</sup></lookup>) <highlightword>sun</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 10:12\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(6,10,12)\">Josh 10:12</ref> +, <bdbheb>שָׁ֑מֶשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 20:43\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"43\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"43\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,43)\">Judg 20:43</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>שִׁמְשֵׁךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 60:20\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(23,60,20)\">Isa 60:20</ref>, <bdbheb>שִׁמְשָׁךְ</bdbheb> <ref r