ָּנֶה</bdbheb>] </div><div class=\"point\"><b>11. 4 a</b> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;\\&emsp;(<highlight>e</highlight>), p. 817), also <ref ref=\"Ps 89:37\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,37)\">Ps 89:37</ref> personified, called to praise <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 148:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"148\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"148\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,148,3)\">Ps 148:3</ref> (+ <bdbheb>יָרֵךְַ</bdbheb>); to be darkened by <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>'s judgment, <ref ref=\"Ezek 32:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,32,7)\">Ezek 32:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Joel 2:10\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(29,2,10)\">Joel 2:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Joel 3:4\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(29,3,4)\">Joel 3:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Joel 4:15\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(29,4,15)\">Joel 4:15</ref> (compare <ref ref=\"Amos 8:9\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(30,8,9)\">Amos 8:9</ref> above, <ref ref=\"Mic 3:6\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(33,3,6)\">Mic 3:6</ref>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <b>of direction:</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִמִּוְרַח הַשּׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 21:11\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(4,21,11)\">Num 21:11</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) <highlight>toward sun-rise, = East</highlight>, compare <ref ref=\"Deut 4:41\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,41)\">Deut 4:41</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 4:47\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"47\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"47\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,47)\">Deut 4:47</ref> + 16 t. (see <bdbheb>מִוְרָךְ</bdbheb> p. 280); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מְבוֺא הַשּׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 11:30\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(5,11,30)\">Deut 11:30</ref> + 3 t. (see  <bdbheb><reflink>מָבוֺא</reflink></bdbheb> <b>2</b>, p. 99). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <b>object of worship</b> (usually + moon, stars, etc.) <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:5\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,5)\">2Kgs 23:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 8:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,8,2)\">Jer 8:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 8:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,8,16)\">Ezek 8:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 4:19\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,19)\">Deut 4:19</ref> horses given to <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:11\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,11)\">2Kgs 23:11</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מַרְכְּבוֺת השּׁ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:11\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,11)\">2Kgs 23:11</ref>. — See also <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בֵּית שׁ</bdbheb> p. 112:b. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> other phrase: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נֶגֶד חַשּׁ</bdbheb>, i.e. <highlight>openly, publicly</highlight>, <ref ref=\"2Sam 12:12\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(10,12,12)\">2Sam 12:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 25:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,25,4)\">Num 25:4</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), so <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְעֵינֵי חַשּׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 12:11\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(10,12,11)\">2Sam 12:11</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> figurative of living, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>חָזָה שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 58:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"58\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"58\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,58,9)\">Ps 58:9</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>רָאָה שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 6:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,6,5)\">Exod 6:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 7:11\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(2,7,11)\">Exod 7:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 11:7\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(2,11,7)\">Exod 11:7</ref>, opposed to <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>תֶּחְשַׁךְ הַשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 12:2\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(2,12,2)\">Exod 12:2</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>תַּחַת הַשּׁ</bdbheb>, i. e. on the earth, <ref ref=\"Eccl 1:3\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(21,1,3)\">Eccl 1:3</ref> + 28 t. Ecclesiastes (compare Greek <grk>ὐφ’ ἠλίῳ</grk>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kue')\">Kue<sup>Ond. iii. 196</sup></lookup>; Ein1. iii. 192). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <highlight>pinnacle</highlight>, as <highlight>glittering, shining</highlight>, plural <ref ref=\"Isa 54:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"54\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"54\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,54,12)\">Isa 54:12</ref> <highlight>thy pinnacles, battlements</highlight> (of Zion), so perhaps singular <bdbheb>אֱםהִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וּמָנֵן י</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 84:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"84\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"84\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,84,12)\">Ps 84:12</ref> <highlight>battlement and shield is</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gr')\">Gr</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bae')\">Bae</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Du')\">Du</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl</lookup>; most <highlight>sun</highlight>, and so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Thes')\">Thes</lookup> <lookup onclick=\